                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The high shelf is where Victory Road stops being polite. I sit it because someone has to be the near-last wall. I saw you the whole climb up - there is no cover this high. Bring everything."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Garchomp does not lose to teams that are only good. It loses to teams that are ready. Are you ready, or just tired?"
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The Road weeds out the resemblances from the real thing. You have the face the Board keeps a bounty on. Up here that buys you nothing but my full attention."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Drake Ironclaw",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
